WEBVTT

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:02.440
Andalanmu itu Klan Sinar dari Dorja?

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.400
(Episode 35)

00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:03.840
Terus kenapa?

00:00:04.120 --> 00:00:06.160
Jangan kira karena berkuasa di Daya

00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:07.160
kamu bisa seenaknya

00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:08.200
Percaya atau gak

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:10.680
satu kataku bisa membuat Klan Sinar

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:11.760
menghukum kamu

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:12.680
Percaya atau gak

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:13.720
satu katamu itu

00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:15.520
bisa mencelakai 
Klan Sinar?

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:20.440
Haha, hanya orang lumpuh sepertimu?

00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:22.320
Hei!

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:23.360
Mau apa?

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:28.480
Seorang wanita desa

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:29.800
dan orang lumpuh

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:31.360
semuanya sombong

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:33.800
Kalian berdua memang pasangan serasi

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:34.680
Cih

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:41.160
Ada wanita, 
bernama Lili

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:43.720
kekasihnya itu 
Tuan Klan Sinar

00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:45.840
Dia bilang, 
mulai sekarang

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:47.760
Klan Sinar akan menghukumku

00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:48.880
Tuan, harap tenang

00:00:49.240 --> 00:00:50.840
Klan Sinar berani macam-macam?

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:54.080
Dalam 3 menit, buat Klan Sinar lenyap

00:00:54.520 --> 00:00:54.800
Baik!

00:00:54.840 --> 00:00:56.280
Kamu... 
Kamu...

00:00:56.880 --> 00:00:57.800
Satu kata darimu

00:00:58.200 --> 00:00:59.000
sudah mencelakai

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:00.680
Klan Sinar yang 
jauh di sana

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:01.480
Sekarang

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:03.560
Klan Sinar pasti mencarimu 

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:04.840
seperti orang gila

00:01:05.320 --> 00:01:06.200
Biarkan dia pergi

00:01:06.840 --> 00:01:07.720
Aku mau lihat

00:01:07.960 --> 00:01:09.440
gimana Klan Sinar 
yang dia andalkan 

00:01:09.800 --> 00:01:10.760
akan menghukumnya

00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:11.880
Nona Lili, silakan

